      "answer": "The approved live patch window for City of Verdant Bay is 2026-03-24 02:00-04:00 local, and it is explicitly marked customer approved. [art_fff67d92fe41]\n\nIf the validation checks fail, the rollback is:\n- If any validation check fails during the live patch validation step, execute automatic rollback to the pre-patch ruleset / prior ruleset. [art_fff67d92fe41]\n- Run `orchestrator rollback --target ruleset=<prior_sha>`. [art_fff67d92fe41]\n- That command rehydrates the prior rules and replays the invalidation hook. [art_fff67d92fe41]\n- After rollback, notify Verdant Bay, open an incident for manual remediation, and revert any partial replays. [art_fff67d92fe41]",
