      "answer": "For the MapleHarvest Quebec pilot, the temporary SI-CLOUD-ROUTER transform is planned to map `txn_id -> transaction_id` and `total_amount -> amount_cents`, preserve `store_id` and `register_id`, and apply `string -> int` type coercion. [art_5a91258f4056]\n\nThe March 23 workshop is supposed to produce a signed schema document uploaded to SI-SCHEMA-REG, plus a change control ticket that includes producer migration milestones. [art_5a91258f4056]",
