      "answer": "Pioneer Freight Solutions is the best-supported customer as most likely to defect to a cheaper tactical competitor if the next promised milestone is missed, because their team said they had already started a NoiseGuard PoC and that if Northstar cannot show full recovery in 6 weeks, procurement will push to extend NoiseGuard and potentially reduce Northstar scope; the competitor report also says that if Northstar misses acceptance milestones, procurement is likely to extend NoiseGuard and reduce scope with Northstar, and that retention risk is high. [art_a504e4c5b6f8] [art_ac8afb52f2d3]\n\nThe cheaper tactical competitor in that case is NoiseGuard. [art_a504e4c5b6f8] [art_ac8afb52f2d3]\n\nThe next promised milestone is: verify schema registry compatibility and collect taxonomy snapshot \u2014 due 2026-03-22. [art_7373b64fdfdd]\n\nThat milestone is also reflected in the renewal call as schema verification by 2026-03-22, with the broader agreed remediation sequence after that being shadow index build 2026-03-29 to 2026-04-09, backfill + rebuild 2026-04-12 to 2026-04-30, and validation window 2026-05-01 to 2026-05-14. [art_a504e4c5b6f8] [art_7373b64fdfdd]",
