      "answer": "The 12 North America West Event Nexus accounts split cleanly into two groups. [ACCOUNT_LOOKUP_COVERAGE]\n\nTaxonomy/search-semantics problems:\n- Arcadia Cloudworks \u2014 the issue is \u201csearch relevance for incident lookup and playbook-trigger matching degraded after taxonomy v2.1 rollout,\u201d with missing or low-ranked relevant incidents. [art_90991e25335f]\n- BlueHarbor Logistics \u2014 this is still taxonomy/search-semantics-centered: the ticket is \u201cSearch relevance degraded after taxonomy rollout on 2026-02-20,\u201d and although it mentions duplicate results, the stated pain point is search relevance degradation after taxonomy changes. [art_8b0063fbb3cb]\n- CedarWind Renewables \u2014 the ticket says search relevance for incident lookups fell from ~68% to ~32% after a recent taxonomy update, with unrelated incidents returned. [art_10f7e8b72e09]\n- HelioFab Systems \u2014 this is also taxonomy/search-semantics-centered: the titled issue is \u201cSearch relevance for taxonomy-based queries dropped after HelioFab's March 2026 taxonomy refactor,\u201d even though the excerpt also mentions missed dedupe matches. [art_9345d5653840]\n- Pacific Health Network \u2014 the ticket says search results and incident grouping have returned low-relevance matches since the taxonomy update on 2026-03-02, with runbook triggers misfiring. [art_4eccfd9dcf29]\n- Pioneer Freight Solutions \u2014 the issue is low-relevance search results after a taxonomy update, with suspicion of a schema version mismatch between the Event Nexus index and the Asset Management service. [art_3ba29fe1e026]\n\nDuplicate-action / duplicate-deduplication problems:\n- Helix Assemblies Inc. \u2014 the problem is a high rate of duplicate incident executions and repeated remediation playbook runs, tied to suspected idempotency key mismatch between ERP and AcqERP. [art_0ac4efa5a0ff]\n- LedgerBright Analytics \u2014 the ticket is about duplicate incidents and missing deduplication across cross-system handoffs after acquisition consolidation. [art_8478ccd5b200]\n- LedgerPeak Software \u2014 the issue is duplicate incidents and automated actions after post-acquisition cutover, with confirmed duplicate id key fields and temporary suppression applied. [art_2f780acc1f96]\n- MedLogix Distribution \u2014 the customer reports a surge in duplicate incidents tied to cross-system handoffs after acquiring NorthValve Systems, with initial triage pointing to an idempotency key schema mismatch. [art_87b096c2c2d3]\n- Peregrine Logistics Group \u2014 the ticket is a spike in duplicate runbook executions and duplicate incident creation after systems consolidation, with suspected idempotency mismatch between legacy WMS and new TMS. [art_0927b1cbb7f4]\n- Pioneer Grid Retail LLC \u2014 the issue is duplicated remediation runs and duplicated incidents since 2026-02-22 after integration of AcquiBill v2 topics, with suspected idempotency key mismatch. [art_f64972a66eeb]",
